+/*
+ * xxHash - Extremely Fast Hash algorithm
+ * Header File
+ * Copyright (C) 2012-2023 Yann Collet
+ *
+ * BSD 2-Clause License (https://www.opensource.org/licenses/bsd-license.php)
+ *
